Arithmetic operand pairs the reference's type tables do not accept
(diag.arithmetic_type_mismatch, warning, on the operator): string minus
number, boolean times number, % with a string, .T. - .F. (a same-type
pair - still rejects), and a call operand typed by its documented return
(Len(...) * "2"). The string-operand and other-pair messages differ.
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE Crunch;
	:PARAMETERS sText, bDone;
	:DECLARE nOut, bFlag;
	nOut := "abc" - 1;
	nOut := bDone * 2;
	nOut := 10 % "3";
	bFlag := .T. - .F.;
	nOut := Len(sText) * "2";
	nOut := 2 ^ "3";
	:RETURN nOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE Crunch;
	:PARAMETERS sText, bDone;
	:DECLARE nOut, bFlag;

	nOut := "abc" - 1;
	nOut := bDone * 2;
	nOut := 10 % "3";
	bFlag := .T. - .F.;
	nOut := Len(sText) * "2";
	nOut := 2 ^ "3";

	:RETURN nOut;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
4:16-4:17 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: String in arithmetic operation '-': string - number. Arithmetic operators require numeric operands
5:16-5:17 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: Non-numeric type in arithmetic operation '*': boolean * number. The operator does not accept this operand pair and raises a runtime error
6:13-6:14 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: String in arithmetic operation '%': number % string. Arithmetic operators require numeric operands
7:15-7:16 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: Non-numeric type in arithmetic operation '-': boolean - boolean. The operator does not accept this operand pair and raises a runtime error
8:21-8:22 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: String in arithmetic operation '*': number * string. Arithmetic operators require numeric operands
9:12-9:13 warning arithmetic_type_mismatch: String in arithmetic operation '^': number ^ string. Arithmetic operators require numeric operands
